# Architecture Overview

```
src/app/
  app.ts, app.config.ts, app.routes.ts   # app-shell — never imported elsewhere
  core/          # auth, Firebase, layout, cross-feature domain (core/domains/)
  shared/        # business-agnostic UI kit, map helpers
  features/{name}/
    domain/      # models, pure functions
    data-access/ # Firestore/HTTP repositories
    state/       # signal stores — facade for UI and WebMCP
    shell/       # app-shell slots (smart wiring for header chrome)
    ui/          # dumb presentational components
    pages/       # smart route components
    webmcp/      # agent tools
```

## Package rules

| Package | May import |
|---------|------------|
| app-shell | core, shared, features (pages, webmcp) |
| core | core, shared |
| shared | shared only |
| features | shared, core, **own feature only** |

Features are fully isolated. Shared logic between features goes in `core/domains/`, not cross-feature imports.

Enforced by `eslint.boundaries.config.js` — run `npm run lint` after changes.
